                        target="frus1931-41v01#pg_13"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>,
                        pp. 13</ref> and <ref target="frus1931-41v01#pg_59">59</ref>.</p>
            </note>
